action)\n  Resolves: RHEL-149438</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Tony Camuso &lt;tcamuso@redhat.com&gt; - 1:1.11.12-1" date="1779105600">- Rebase to upstream tboot 1.11.12\n  Drop tboot-gcc14.patch (fix absorbed upstream)\n  Resolves: RHEL-177574</changelog>\n</package>\n')
